---
---

<section class="why-kim" id="about">
    <div class="container">
        
        <div class="image-column">
            <div class="portrait-wrapper" aria-label="Portrait of Kim, PA-C"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-column">
            <h2>Meet Your Advocate</h2>
            <span class="credentials">Kim, PA-C — Founder</span>
            
            <div class="bio-content">
                <p>
                    With 18 years of clinical experience as a Physician Assistant specializing in oncology, bone marrow transplant, and orthopedics, I have seen the healthcare system from the inside.
                </p>
                <p>
                    I know what it takes to get answers, and I know how easily things can fall through the cracks when a patient's care spans multiple specialists, brilliant doctors, and busy institutions.
                </p>
                <p class="philosophy">
                    My commitment is simple: I sit on your side of the table, speak your doctors' language, and make sure you have the clarity to make the right decisions.
                </p>
            </div>
            
            <a href="/contact" class="link-arrow">Let's talk about your situation &rarr;</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .why-kim {
        padding: 8rem 5%;
        background-color: var(--white);
    }

    .container {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr; /* Slightly asymmetric so the text has room to breathe */
        gap: 6rem;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .image-column {
        width: 100%;
    }

    .portrait-wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 4/5;
        background-color: var(--bg-beige); /* Fallback color */
        /* Replace url with actual portrait of Kim */
        background-image: url('/kim.jpg'); 
        background-position: center;
        background-size: cover;
        border-radius: 4px;
        box-shadow: -15px 15px 0 var(--navy); /* Mirrors the button shadow styling from the hero */
    }

    .text-column h2 {
        font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        color: var(--navy);
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        font-style: italic;
    }

    .credentials {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--royal-blue);
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .bio-content p {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        color: var(--text-dark);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .bio-content p.philosophy {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--navy);
        margin-top: 2rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
        border-left: 3px solid var(--royal-blue);
    }

    .link-arrow {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--royal-blue);
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .link-arrow:hover {
        color: var(--navy);
        transform: translateX(5px);
    }

    /* Responsive Breakpoints */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
        .container {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
        }
        .portrait-wrapper {
            aspect-ratio: 1/1; /* Switch to square on mobile so it doesn't take up the whole screen */
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .text-column h2 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
        }
    }
</style>